. You are the only clinical staff member who has noticed. What you do in the next sixty seconds matters more than anything that happens afterwards."}],"$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]]}]]}]}]]}],false,false,"$L21",false,"$undefined","$L22","$L23"]}]
